  "solution": [
    "Inner: $\\int_0^x xy\\,dy = x\\cdot\\frac{x^2}{2} = \\frac{x^3}{2}$.",
    "Outer: $\\int_0^1 \\frac{x^3}{2}\\,dx = \\frac{1}{8}$."
  ],
